input CLK1 A
output Y
instance ff1 DFF
instance inv1 INV
instance inv2 INV
instance buf1 BUF
net n_clk driver CLK1 load ff1/CLK
net n_a driver A load ff1/D
net n_q driver ff1/Q load inv1/A
net n_l1 driver inv1/Z load inv2/A
net n_l2 driver inv2/Z load inv1/A
net n_out driver inv1/Z load buf1/A
net n_y driver buf1/Z load Y
